              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Eliakimu mwana wa Hilkia, na Shebna, na Joa wikamzera uja m'baa wa majeshi gha Ashuru, “Dakulomba kudedanye nesi wadumiki wako kwa kiteto cha Kiarami, angu dachiichi; kusededanye nesi kwa Kiebrania dikisikirwa ni awandu wiko wurighenyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja m'baa wa majeshi ukawizera, “Kwani bwana wapo odeniduma nighore agha malagho kwa bwana wako na konyu? Nechi odeniduma nighore na awo wandu wiko wurighenyi wapatwa ni malagho gheja mavi ghawo na kunywa maghocho ghawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao uja m'baa wa majeshi ukakaia kimusi ukawoka kudeda na lwaka lubaa kwa kiteto cha Kiebrania, “Sikirenyi seji mzuri m'baa wa Ashuru waghamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Msekalilo ni Hezekia, kwa kukaia ndechaadima kumkira nani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia usemkalie mkusaghike na BWANA ukimzera loli BWANA uchadikira, hata ughu muzi ndeghuwuswagha ni mzuri wa Ashuru kungi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msemsikire Hezekia; kwa kukaia mzuri wa Ashuru wamzera huwu, ‘Bonyenyi sere nani mkufunye, niko kula umu onyu uchaaja mzabibu ghwake na mtini ghwake, na kunywa machi kufuma mtunginyi ghwake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hata nacha na kumghenja isanga jifwanane na jenyu, isanga ja viro na divei, isanga ja mikate na mizabibu, isanga ja mizeituni na wuki; mpate kukaia moyo msefo. Msemsikire Hezekia putu ingelo umzeragha wei BWANA uchamkira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwawonie jingi mlungu ghungi ghwa mbari ingi ghuvuvue isanga jake nisejikabe ini mzuri wa Ashuru? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eko hao milungu ya Hamathi na Arpadi? Eko hao milungu ya Sefavaimu na Hena, na Iva? Jingi yakirie Samaria niseikabe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni masanga ghiao ghikirilo ni milungu yawo, niseghikabe, nao ikaie wei BWANA uchadima kukira muzi ghwa Jerusalemu niseghukabe?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
